"'''Operation: Shadowpoint'''" is a free bonus adventure for the [[Star Wars: Age of Rebellion (roleplaying game)|''Star Wars: Age of Rebellion'']] [[Star Wars: Age of Rebellion Beginner Game|''Beginner Game'']], released online [[April 28]], [[2014]]. It was released by [[Fantasy Flight Games]] and written by [[Jordan Goldfarb]] with [[Daniel Lovat Clark]]. It follows immediately after from the Beginner Game adventure [[Takeover at Whisper Base (adventure)|''Takeover at Whisper Base'']].

==Publisher's summary==
''The Star Wars®: Age of Rebellion™ Beginner Game hit stores last week, along with its full-length adventure, ''Takeover at Whisper Base''. Now, you can continue your adventures in ''Operation: Shadowpoint'' (pdf, 6.3 MB), a free adventure for the Beginner Game that is available for download from the game's support page and allows allows you and your friends to explore the Rebellion's efforts beyond ''Takeover at Whisper Base!''''

